    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Am I a hero\u2026 or just a human?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boy named Cade, chosen as the Hero, sets out on a journey to save the world using the power of cards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A New Kind of Gameplay Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new-style RPG fused with card game mechanics.<br>Travel the world and build your very own ultimate deck.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >High-Stakes Real-Time Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles unfold in real time, with no turns to guide you.<br>Will you charge your cost, defend with a shield, or buff yourself for what's to come?<br>Every second\u2014and every decision\u2014can turn the tide of battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Limitless Builds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine level-up rewards, cards, and badges to create endless strategies.<br>Your choices shape the way you fight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, monsters appear in the peaceful world of humans.<br>Where did they come from? Who is the real enemy? And who\u2014what\u2014is Cade himself?<br>As the mysteries of the world unfold, the boy must confront what it truly means to be a hero.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Am I a hero\u2026 or just a human?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boy named Cade, chosen as the Hero, sets out on a journey to save the world using the power of cards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A New Kind of Gameplay Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new-style RPG fused with card game mechanics.<br>Travel the world and build your very own ultimate deck.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >High-Stakes Real-Time Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles unfold in real time, with no turns to guide you.<br>Will you charge your cost, defend with a shield, or buff yourself for what's to come?<br>Every second\u2014and every decision\u2014can turn the tide of battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Limitless Builds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine level-up rewards, cards, and badges to create endless strategies.<br>Your choices shape the way you fight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, monsters appear in the peaceful world of humans.<br>Where did they come from? Who is the real enemy? And who\u2014what\u2014is Cade himself?<br>As the mysteries of the world unfold, the boy must confront what it truly means to be a hero.</p>",
    "short_description": "A new kind of real-time RPG fused with card game mechanics! Join the hero Cade on an epic journey to save the world from an unknown threat. Team up with unique allies, and collect powerful cards and badges to build your ultimate deck.",
